| Problem / Symptom             | Look at             | Why                       | Where to Debug                            |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Pod Pending (NODE = `<none>`) | Scheduler (cluster) | No suitable node          | `kubectl describe pod` (FailedScheduling) |
| Pod Pending (NODE assigned)   | Node (kubelet)      | Node can’t start pod      | `kubectl describe pod`, events            |
| ContainerCreating too long    | Node (kubelet)      | Image pull / volume / CNI | `kubectl describe pod`, node logs         |
