| CrashLoopBackOff              | Node / App          | App crashes               | `kubectl logs`, `--previous`              |
| Pod OOMKilled                 | Node / Container    | Memory limit exceeded     | `kubectl describe pod`, metrics           |
| Pod stuck Terminating         | Node / API          | Finalizer / volume issue  | `kubectl describe pod`, finalizers        |
| Pod restarting frequently     | Node                | Liveness probe failing    | `kubectl describe pod`, probes            |


